      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA AURORA (2) has a strong record this track and trip with seven wins and three placings from 18 starts. Hit the frame latest (29.99) when third at this track in a Grade 3/4. Expected to go close. TUCKEROO ROAD (8) made it two minor placings on the trot when beaten third (30.17) in a Grade 5 at this track last time out. Has good speed and can quickly clear the pack out wide. Can feature with the right run. JANE'S FURY (7) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 2.5 lengths at this track in a handy 30.13 beating Unique Reward. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Leading chance again. FLYAWAY JACK (1) cannot be left out after placing last start.",
